# MoonBit: MoonBit language documentation (docs.moonbitlang.com); requirements/languages/moonbit.md
name     moonbit mbt
keyword  fn let mut if else match while for in loop break continue return struct enum trait impl type
keyword  pub priv test guard try catch raise with as derive typealias
type     Int Int64 UInt Double Float Bool String Char Unit Array Map Option Result Bytes
builtin  true false None Some Ok Err println self
line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
escape        : paren u-braces
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
